"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_INT_OrpheusMonksBook_03\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_INT_OrpheusMonksBook_03\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5b32ec11-7aa3-431c-a6a9-f861fd3a7e4a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5b32ec11-7aa3-431c-a6a9-f861fd3a7e4a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5b32ec11-7aa3-431c-a6a9-f861fd3a7e4a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_chambers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Balthazar's chambers\">Balthazar's chambers</a> in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonrise Towers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-128&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-182</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this book advances <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Discover_the_History_of_Prince_Orpheus\" title=\"Discover the History of Prince Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Discover the History of Prince Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Discover_the_History_of_Prince_Orpheus\" title=\"Discover the History of Prince Orpheus\">Discover the History of Prince Orpheus</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The histories tell us that Commander <a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a>, Jhe'stil Kith'rak, pierced Prince Orpheus clean through with his sword of silver. That his flesh was torn and fed to the great red dragon <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ephelomon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ephelomon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ephelomon\">Ephelomon</a></span>.\n</p><p><br>\nVlaakith's faithful roar out this tale. But beneath the roars, we hear whispers carrying truth and prophecy.\n</p><p><br>\nThe Prince of the Comet is not dead.\n</p><p>The Prince of the Comet will come again.\n</p><p>The Prince of the Comet will liberate us from Vlaakith's tyranny.\n</p><p><br>\nPraise be to Mother <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith\">Gith</a></span>, Queen of the One Sky! Praise be to your son Orpheus, the True Heir, Prince of the Comet!\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The slate is titled <b>Engraved Githyanki Disc</b> prior to reading it. It must be deciphered by:\n<ul><li>Giving it to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a></li>\n<li>Obtaining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Careful_Art_of_Tir%27su_Ciphers\" title=\"The Careful Art of Tir'su Ciphers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Careful_Art_of_Tir%27su_Ciphers\" title=\"The Careful Art of Tir'su Ciphers\">The Careful Art of Tir'su Ciphers</a></li>\n<li>Obtaining the second part of the series, which can be used in place of the cipher</li>\n<li>Passing an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;20 Investigation Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;20 <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\">Investigation</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> check</li>\n<li>Passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;12 History Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;12 <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> check with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> - only available to Githyanki - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguise Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguise Self</a> does not work</li></ul></li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus,_Prince_of_the_Comet,_Part_One:_Betrayal\" title=\"Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part One: Betrayal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus,_Prince_of_the_Comet,_Part_One:_Betrayal\" title=\"Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part One: Betrayal\">Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part One: Betrayal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus,_Prince_of_the_Comet,_Part_Two:_Sacrifice\" title=\"Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part Two: Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus,_Prince_of_the_Comet,_Part_Two:_Sacrifice\" title=\"Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part Two: Sacrifice\">Orpheus, Prince of the Comet, Part Two: Sacrifice</a></span></li></ul></li>\n<li>If the party acquire one or more of the above <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slates\" title=\"Githyanki Slates\">Githyanki Slates</a>, they may be used as part of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel's</a> idle animations at <a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">camp</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 84293/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28400/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.032/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1220393/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  109.420      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%  109.420      1 -total\n 58.51%   64.016     21 Template:Icon_text\n 51.20%   56.025     67 Template:Trim\n 26.95%   29.485     13 Template:Icon_link\n 20.01%   21.900      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.96%   21.836  